{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05301","headline":"奉和九日幸临渭亭登高应制得日字 · 郑南金","name":"奉和九日幸临渭亭登高应制得日字","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"重阳玉律应，万乘金舆出。\n风起韵虞弦，云开吐尧日。\n菊花浮圣酒，茱香挂衰质。\n欲知恩煦多，顺动观秋实。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郑南金","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05301.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05301","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}